          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambiire ati, “Inywe Baisiraeli mukanfakalira mara mwanshenga. Mbwenu mushenguruguke, mugaruke ahali inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanya kaliho orwo mulikwija kunaga ebihuuku ebyo mufukamira ebikoziibwe efeza n'ezahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaasiria nibaija kugwa aha mbanda; titulikwija kwitwa muntu. Barasingwa bairuke kyonkai abasigazi babe bairu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama wabo arakwatwa obutini bungi muno airuke, n'abakuru baratina baanageho ebendera zabo z'endashana.” Omukama n'iwe alikugamba, Omukama owo bafukamira omuli Sioni, Omukama owo batambira ebitambo by'okwokibwa omuli Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
